{"_id":"68d3ffcc166b018f83df6347","roadmapSlug":"html","nodeId":"UevJNi2HHNzpCAx7Icd0k","description":"# Embedding Media\n\nEmbedding media in HTML involves integrating multimedia content like images, audio, and video directly into a webpage. This allows users to view or listen to these elements without having to download them separately or navigate to another site. HTML provides specific elements, such as `<img>`, `<audio>`, and `<video>`, to facilitate this embedding process, along with attributes to control their appearance and behavior.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Adding Media","url":"https://learn.shayhowe.com/html-css/adding-media/","_id":"6a71e295b0650226a59f1b99"}],"createdAt":"2025-09-24T14:27:24.248Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-04T13:01:09.024Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a10b41ba95e0d5c68dede2f","title":"HTML Fundamentals","slug":"html","description":"Enough HTML to read, write, inspect, and understand real web pages.","lessonIds":["6a0da437a95e0d5c68ded033","6a0ef00da95e0d5c68ded162","6a0f1366a95e0d5c68ded2b4","6a0f2262a95e0d5c68ded32a","6a0f33e7a95e0d5c68ded463","6a102d2fa95e0d5c68ded758","6a106a2ba95e0d5c68deda00","6a107b29a95e0d5c68deda53"],"projectIds":["68b7185fffbff9183d772aea","68b7185fffbff9183d772aeb","6a1485bfac1c5fa9928a2087","6a1485c5ac1c5fa9928a2093","6a1485cbac1c5fa9928a2099","6a1485d1ac1c5fa9928a20a4"],"featuredImage":"","readingTime":58,"lessonCount":8,"quizCount":0,"projectCount":6}],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/html/content/UevJNi2HHNzpCAx7Icd0k.md"}